		{
			title = "Summary",
			text = [=[The Garrison Armory lies in the hills behind {link:nethergarde-keep}Nethergarde Keep{/link}, where the {link:kirin-tor}Kirin Tor{/link}'s garrison has opened mines in the red rock. Miners of Nethergarde work its tunnels under the eyes of foremen and engineers. The ore they bring up is one of the few things the {link:blasted-lands}Blasted Lands{/link} give freely. It forges the keep's arms and pays for part of the goods that must come by road from the north. It is hard work in a hard place, and the miners know that the soldiers on the walls above them are all that stand between the shafts and the ogres of the waste.]=],
