	sections = {
		{
			title = "Summary",
			text = [=[Dreadmaul Hold is the stronghold of the Dreadmaul ogres in the north-west of the {link:blasted-lands}Blasted Lands{/link}, close by the pass that leads down from the swamp. Its brutes and {link:ogres}ogre{/link} magi raid the road to {link:nethergarde-keep}Nethergarde{/link}, and they have made the northern wastes dangerous for any caravan. Their master is {link:grol-the-destroyer}Grol the Destroyer{/link}. He was once an ogre chieftain like any other, but he sold himself to the demon {link:razelikh-the-defiler}Razelikh{/link} for immortality, and he is an ogre no longer. Within the hold, three enslaved soldiers of a lost {link:horde}Horde{/link} regiment stand bound to his service. They cannot die, and they cannot leave.]=],
