			text = [=[The Serpent's Coil is a winding maze of caves in the east of the {link:blasted-lands}Blasted Lands{/link}. Burnt shells of orcish buildings stand before its mouths, left from the wars. The cultists of the Shadowsworn have made it their den, and {link:archmage-allistarj}Archmage Allistarj{/link} commands them from within. It was here that the soldiers of a lost {link:horde}Horde{/link} regiment were tortured, and here that their lieutenant, {link:kirith-the-damned}Kirith{/link}, was broken. In the deepest cave a monstrous fel beast now prowls. It was once a man, and it still has a name.]=],
