			title = "Significance",
			text = [=[When the Legion was defeated and {link:lord-kazzak}Kazzak{/link} withdrew into the {link:the-tainted-scar}Tainted Scar{/link}, Razelikh was sent to secure the land. He did so with cunning more than force. While the {link:alliance}Alliance{/link} and the {link:horde}Horde{/link} quarrelled over lands far to the north, he drew together the scattered sects of the {link:shadow-council}Shadow Council{/link} and the Dreadmaul ogres. The price he offered was power. He made an amulet, broke it into three, and gave one piece each to {link:archmage-allistarj}Archmage Allistarj{/link}, {link:lady-sevine}Lady Sevine{/link} and {link:grol-the-destroyer}Grol the Destroyer{/link}. Each piece made its bearer undying within the {link:blasted-lands}Blasted Lands{/link}. Each also bound its bearer to serve him for ever. His three captains did not understand the second gift until it was too late.]=],
